      "name": "plan",
      "kind": "langchain",
      "description": "Manage a short ordered task list (max 12 items, 200 chars each) in working state. Supports write (replace list), append (add items), complete (mark one done by 0-indexed id), and clear. The plan list survives compaction and is injected into every prompt recitation. Available in landing, hosting, and embedded profiles only.",
      "mutates_page": false,
      "cacheable": false,
